meta {
  name: Credentials
  seq: 4
}

docs {
  Protected broker credentials:
  - GET    /v1/credentials
  - POST   /v1/credentials
  - PUT    /v1/credentials/:id
  - PUT    /v1/credentials/:id/pause | /resume
  - POST   /v1/credentials/:id/verify
  - DELETE /v1/credentials/:id
  - GET    /v1/brokers/enabled

  **Create templates**
  - create-zerodha, create-angel, create-dhan, create-mt5 — single product
  - create-multi-product-pro-plus — `products: ["MIS","CNC","NRML"]` (**pro_plus only**)
  - create-live — expect 403 on free/paper plans
  - create-demo — legacy alias (prefer account_mode: live on pro+)

  **Product fields (Indian brokers)**
  - Single (free/paper/pro): `"product": "MIS"|"CNC"|"NRML"`
  - Multi (pro_plus): `"products": ["MIS","CNC","NRML"]` — at least one required
  - Responses include both `product` (default) and `products` (full list)

  **Live signals:** when `products` has more than one entry, each signal must include
  `"product": "MIS"|"CNC"|"NRML"` — see Signals/ingest-indian-cnc.

  **Encryption:** send secrets only in `raw_creds`; server stores AES-256-GCM ciphertext.

  **Verify:** POST /v1/credentials/:id/verify — may return `error_code` + `hint`.
}
